WHERE  "collection_id" IN ('tcga_luad','tcga_lusc')
  AND  "ImageType" ILIKE '%VOLUME%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
--Description: Confirm that slide-microscopy (SM) modality images exist for the two collections in the pivot table.
